GraphPad.com offers a free online tool to carry out simple linear regressions. Just go to \href{https://www.graphpad.com/quickcalcs/linear1/}{www.graphpad.com/quickcalcs/linear1} and enter the data into the table. Then click on \emph{Calculate Now} to obtain the results. You will find the slope listed and the $r^2$ listed under the Goodness of fit section. Interestingly, the error in the slope is also listed. Using this simple online tool, you can carry out a linear regression even without a calculator.